OL,3,ABritish man infected with Ebola in DR
OL,4,ACongo to be flown back to UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British man who has tested positive
OL,7,Ffor Ebola in the Democratic Republic of
OL,8,FCongo will be flown back to the UK.
OL,10,FIt is the first confirmed case of a UK
OL,11,Fnational contracting Ebola during the
OL,12,Fmost recent outbreak of the rare but
OL,13,Fdeadly virus in DR Congo, which has so
OL,14,Ffar led to more than 5,000 deaths.
OL,16,FIt is not clear when the flight will
OL,17,Ftake place.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
